sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as web/chat.html
  participant T as Chat Trigger
  participant A as AI Agent
  participant M as Chat Memory
  participant S as Tool SQL
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant L as Bedrock
  U->>T: POST {action, sessionId, chatInput} + Basic Auth
  T-->>U: 401 jika login salah
  T->>A: chatInput + sessionId
  A->>M: ambil riwayat (10 pesan terakhir)
  A->>L: prompt sistem + riwayat + daftar tool
  L-->>A: panggil tool (mis. cari_selisih)
  A->>S: parameter dari AI (status, jumlah)
  S->>D: query tetap, terparameter ($1, $2)
  D-->>S: baris hasil
  S-->>A: data
  A->>L: data tool
  L-->>A: jawaban akhir (angka dikutip dari data)
  A->>M: simpan percakapan
  A-->>U: {output: jawaban}
